You are scoring an email phishing analyst on TWO axes. Ground-truth label: "{{ item.reference.label }}". The email's genuine red flags are:
{% for flag in item.reference.red_flags %}- {{ flag }}
{% endfor %}
The agent's response may contain reasoning; extract its final verdict (the last clear "phishing" or "benign").

Agent response:
{{ sample.output_text }}

Respond with a JSON object {"accuracy": <value>, "cites_red_flags": <value>} where accuracy is 1 if the extracted verdict matches the expected label else 0, and cites_red_flags is the fraction (0 to 1) of the listed red flags the agent's justification clearly references.
